  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your shikigami's connections with the minor kami of the spirit world are fairly extensive.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Aid of the Arcane OR Aid of the Earth OR Aid of the Minor Deity OR Aid of the Minstrel</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may cast each of the spell-like abilities granted by the Aid of the Arcane, Aid of the Earth, Aid of the Minor Deity, and Aid of the Minstrel feats an additional time per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
